    "description": "With Picrew's intuitive character creator, anyone can easily design their own characters. Our easy-to-use character maker is perfect for both beginners and experienced users.\r\n\r\nPicrew is a platform where you can create characters, portraits, and icons completely free of charge. With over 10,000 Image Makers available, whether you're looking for an OC maker, portrait maker, or character creator, Picrew has it all!\r\n\r\nIn addition, as an avatar maker, Picrew allows you to create avatars that look just like yourself by combining facial features or dressing up stylishly with different clothing parts. You can also make your own character that reflects your unique style. The images you create can be downloaded for free or shared on social media.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, Picrew features Image Makers created by creators from all over the world, with various tastes such as cute, cool, stylish, or maybe a little scary? There are so many different Image Makers available that you're sure to find your favorite!\r\n\r\nCurrently, the 'create Image Makers' function is only available on our website. Please visit https://picrew.me/ to explore this feature.\r\n\r\n\u3010Feature Introduction\u3011\r\n\r\n- Dress-up Maker and Random Maker\r\nThe Dress-up Maker allows you to create your favorite images by selecting parts yourself. The Random Maker lets you create images based on luck, so you can enjoy it like a fortune-telling or a random drawing.\r\n\r\n- Social Media Integration\r\nYou can easily share the images you create on social media platforms such as Facebook, X, LINE, etc.\r\n\r\n- Search\r\nYou can search for Image Makers by narrowing down options such as keywords or available categories.\r\n\r\n- Tag\r\nYou can search for Image Makers based on tags set by the creators of the Image Makers.\r\n\r\n- Bookmark\r\nYou can save your favorite Image Makers for easy access.\r\n\r\n- Report\r\nIf you come across an Image Maker that violates the terms of service or guidelines, you can report it to the administration.\r\n\r\n- Block\r\nYou can block Image Makers that you don't want to see.\r\n\r\n\u3010Features\u3011\r\n- Design charming portraits using our portrait maker\r\n- Design your own icons using our icon maker tool\r\n- Craft your own character with our anime-style avatar maker\r\n- Use our character creator to make your own character that looks just like you\r\n- Easily create social media icons with our icon maker\r\n- Design original characters using our character maker and OC maker\r\n- Combine parts to create a character with our portrait maker\r\n- Freely customize and create a character with our versatile character creator\r\n- Effortlessly create cute characters with our intuitive character maker\r\n\r\n\u3010Target Recommendations\u3011\r\n- Enjoy creating avatars and icons for free\r\n- Looking for an easy-to-use icon maker or avatar maker\r\n- Want to create original characters with a character creator\r\n- Enjoy customizing characters in a character maker\r\n- Want to kill time by using an OC maker\r\n\r\n\u3010Things to Keep in Mind\u3011\r\nImages created with Picrew's Image Makers can only be used within the guidelines set by both the creator and Picrew. Each Image Maker creator defines how their images can be used, with options such as personal use, non-commercial use, commercial use, and modifications. Some creators may also include specific requests or limitations in the Image Maker's description. Before using any Image Maker, please check the allowed uses and carefully read any guidelines or requests provided by the creator.\r\n\r\n\u3010About Administration\u3011\r\nWe continuously monitor the platform to maintain a safe and enjoyable environment. Users can report inappropriate content, and we take appropriate actions when necessary.\r\n\r\n\u3010Contact Us\u3011\r\nIf you have any issues or feedback, please contact us: https://support.picrew.me/en/contact\r\n\r\nDownload Picrew now and start creating your own characters today!\r\n\r\n\u3010Follow Us\u3011\r\nWebsite: https://tetrachroma.co.jp/\r\nX (Twitter): [@picrew_tc_en](https://twitter.com/picrew_tc_en)",
